                "title": "Fancy Beaded Lever",
                "description": "Simple hobnail styling around the edge of this  Beaded Solid Brass Leverset grants this Omnia made traditional latchset a glamor without being gaudy. The textured inlay of the handle adds just enough opulent detail to add a subtle point of interest to more ritzy decors. The Fancy Beaded Lever is Available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.\r\n",
